ingredients:
  - "10 Lady’s Fingers (Okra)"
  - "2 tsp Oil"
  - "1 tsp Gram Flour"
  - "1/4 tsp Red Chili Powder"
  - "1/4 tsp Amchur Powder"
  - "1/4 tsp Garam Masala"
  - "1/4 tsp Turmeric Powder"
  - "Salt to taste"
instructions:
  - "Cut lady’s finger lengthwise into four pieces."
  - "Spread the pieces on a tray."
  - "Sprinkle salt, chili powder, garam masala, and amchur powder. Mix gently."
  - "Sprinkle gram flour evenly over the okra."
  - "Heat oil in a pan and fry small portions until golden brown and crisp."
  - "Serve hot and enjoy your crispy okra fry."
